## Installation

{{#ifSatisfy "equals" model.implementation.tags "cli"}}
To install the CLI tool:
```bash
go install github.com/{{model.github.account}}/{{model.github.name}}@latest
```

To run directly from source:
```bash
git clone https://github.com/{{model.github.account}}/{{model.github.name}}.git
cd {{model.github.name}}
go run ./cmd/{{model.github.name}}
```
{{/ifSatisfy}}
{{#ifSatisfy "not equals" model.implementation.tags "cli"}}
To use as a module in your Go project:
```go
import "github.com/{{model.github.account}}/{{model.github.name}}"
```
Install the module:
```bash
go get github.com/{{model.github.account}}/{{model.github.name}}@latest
```
{{/ifSatisfy}}
